== Trivia ==
* Unlike {{tf|Guppy}} items, this trinket doesn't have the "Guppy" tag (in items_metadata.xml) and seems to be hard-coded to count toward the total. This may have to do with how trinkets in general, with or without an applicable tag, don't count toward transformations or unlock requirements.
* This is the only trinket ({{dlc|r+}} one of the only three trinkets) that counts toward a transformation, {{dlc|r+}} the other ones are {{t|Bob's Bladder}} and {{t|A Missing Page}}.

